{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34162","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 以毛公泉献大谏清河公 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 以毛公泉献大谏清河公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生链飞精，羽化成翩翻。\n荒坛与古甃，隐轸清泠存。\n四面蹙山骨，中心含月魂。\n除非紫水脉，即是金沙源。\n香实洒桂蘂，甘惟渍云根。\n向来探幽人，酌罢祛蒙昏。\n况公珪璋质，近处谏诤垣。\n又闻虚静姿，早挂冰雪痕。\n君对瑶华味，重献兰薰言。\n当应涤烦暑，朗咏翬飞轩。\n我愿得一掬，攀天呌重阍。\n霏霏散爲雨，用以移焦原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}